{"id":1161002,"name":"卡兹安·审查Ⅱ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"卡兹安·审查Ⅱ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1161002]}],"trial":{"trial_id":161002,"stage":"阶段2","unlock_time":"2025-09-23 14:00:00","diary1":"平反材料整理完毕后，你与卡兹安同行前往递交，却在途中意外遇见一位昔日熟人。","diary2":"卡兹安第一次对高高在上的贵族“旧友”进行了反击，并与你一同前去探望了因牵连而含冤入狱多年的“叔叔”。在那双依然温柔坚定的眼睛前，他终于崩溃，泪如雨下，将压抑多年的悲伤与痛苦尽数倾泻。\n　　再次行走在新城洒满阳光、人群熙攘的街头，卡兹安宛若新生。他第一次意识到，原来这个世界上还有人希望他活着。也许，并非所有过去都无法被修正。\n　　可当他习惯性地去触摸自己随身携带的家族胸针时，却发现它已不知所踪。","evidence":[{"ID":260783,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260784,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":261002023,"next":null},{"step":24,"cour